    "directions": [
      "Marinade the fish with salt and turmeric powder.",
      "Keep aside for further use.",
      "In a small bowl, add salt, turmeric and water to make a thin paste. Keep aside for further use.",
      "In a kadhai, heat mustard oil till smokes.",
      "Once it starts smoking, add fish and shallow fry till done.",
      "Drain the fish in a paper towel and keep aside for further use.",
      "In the same oil, add kalonji, mustard seeds and green chillies, sear them for a minute.",
      "Add the turmeric and salt mixture. Cook it for 2-3 minutes on high flame or until moisture evaporates.",
      "Add marinated fish and stir carefully to avoid breaking, for the masala to coat through it.",
      "Add water as required and cook for another 2-3 minutes.",
      "Garnish with coriander leaves.",
      "Serve hot with rice."
    ],
